			<key>pfm_description</key>
			<string>Sets how long the client can remain disconnected from the tailnet before automatically reconnecting. Use a Go-style duration string, for example 24h or 5h25m30s. An empty string or a zero duration disables automatic reconnection. Can be used with or without AlwaysOn.Enabled.</string>
