			<string>1.74</string>
			<key>pfm_description</key>
			<string>Specifies an auth key used to authenticate managed devices without user interaction. Clients automatically try to use the auth key when launched unless already logged in. Use a one-off auth key tagged for the device, with access control policies that grant only necessary access.</string>
